{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "label": "How a real GOV.UK headline becomes a change in support. These rules are the whole mapping. The headline's title is lower-cased and compared with the phrases below; the first rule with a phrase in it decides. A headline that matches no rule is shown and changes nothing.",
